    "original_gold_lex_dicts": {
        "Id1": {
            "text": "Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense, a club with 17,000 members, played in the Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league in 2015. Vila Nova Futebol Clube, another club, have been champions of Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C. The home stadium for Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense is Est\u00e1dio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca, which is located in Arapiraca, Brazil."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "The Est\u00e1dio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca, the home ground of the team Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense, is located in Arapiraca. Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense, which has 17000 members, plays in the Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league and played in the 2015 season in the league. Vila Nova Futebol Clube are the champions of Campeonato Brasileiro Serie C."
        },
