            "text": "Est\u00e1dio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca in Arapiraca is the name of the ground of Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense. Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense has 17000 members and play in the 2015 Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league in which The Vila Nova Futebol Clube were champions."
